  "description": "A comprehensive .NET library that extends LINQ to Objects with powerful statistical and data science features. Includes: correlation, covariance, standard deviation, variance, distribution analysis (median, quartiles, percentiles, skewness, kurtosis), rolling windows, time-series analysis, linear algebra operations, and geospatial analysis (Haversine distance, radius filtering, nearest neighbor). For GPU-accelerated versions with up to 100x performance on large datasets, also install Mavusi.Linq.DataScience.GpuBound package.",
