  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.0: MAJOR UPDATE - Separated GPU acceleration into dedicated Mavusi.Linq.DataScience.GpuBound package. This package now focuses on CPU-optimized implementations without ILGPU dependencies. For GPU-accelerated methods with up to 100x performance on large datasets, install Mavusi.Linq.DataScience.GpuBound alongside this package. All existing CPU methods remain unchanged and fully functional.",
